Package: blighter-restrictor
Version: 1.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-paramiko, python3-keyring
Recommends: libqt6svg6
Maintainer: Ways Property <ways-property@pm.me>
Description: Blighter Restrictor - parent app
 Graphical app to manage Squid web filtering on children's Ubuntu and Windows laptops
 over the home network: allow/block lists by domain, two filtering modes,
 live configuration view and access-log monitoring.
